lights/tests/search-button.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/airport-autocomplete.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/date-picker.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/recent-searches.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/popular-destinations.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/search-summary-bar.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/track-prices-toggle.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/filter-sidebar.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/filter-sidebar-combined.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/flight-result-card.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/pagination.spec.ts`\n\n### 4. Test Documentation\n**File Path:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md`\n**Key Details:** \n- Comprehensive test specification document (94.6 KB)\n- Documents test cases for all major components:\n  - Search page components (TripTypeSelector, PassengerCountSelector, CabinClassSelector, AirportAutocomplete, DatePicker, SearchButton, RecentSearches, PopularDestinations)\n  - Detailed test scenarios with initial state, actions, and expected outcomes\n  - Component interaction tests\n\n### 5. Playwright Configuration\n**File Path:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n**Key Details:**\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60000ms\n- Expect timeout: 10000ms\n- Uses Replay.io integration for chromium browser\n- Runs with single worker (fullyParallel: false)\n- Reporter: list + JSON output\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Web server: Netlify dev on port 8888\n- Traces enabled on first retry\n\n### 6. Database Schema\n**File Path:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/schema.ts`\n**Key Details:**\n- Uses Neon PostgreSQL serverless\n- Tables:\n  - `airports` - airport information (iata_code, name, city, country, coordinates, timezone)\n  - `airlines` - airline data (iata_code, name, logo_color)\n  - `flights` - main flight data (airline_id, flight_number, route, departure/arrival times, duration, ai